Enumerate(count Number) Numbers
	Squares.Enumerate(3) is (0, 1, 2)
	for count
		value
SquareAll(numbers Numbers) Numbers slow
	Squares.SquareAll((1, 2, 3)) is (1, 4, 9)
	Squares.SquareAll(Squares.Enumerate(70000)).Last is 4899860001
	for numbers
		Square(value)
Square(number Number) Number
	Squares.Square(3) is 9
	number * number
Run
	squared = SquareAll(Enumerate(1000000))
	logger.Log("Sum of squares " + squared.Sum + ", the last is " + squared.Last)